          "guid": "mtj7j7o88kr5ofa4",
          "message": {
            "text": "Clearing the startup timer turns the passing hero gate from a 90-second process into a prompt exit. Before this change the assertions printed success but Pueue stayed running until the timeout fired; afterward the same headless desktop/mobile check completed successfully in about six seconds.",
            "markdown": "Clearing the startup timer turns the passing hero gate from a 90-second process into a prompt exit. Before this change the assertions printed success but Pueue stayed running until the timeout fired; afterward the same headless desktop/mobile check completed successfully in about six seconds."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "site/scripts/check-hero-layout.mjs"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 46,
                  "endLine": 67,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    const finish = (settle, value) => {\n      clearTimeout(timer);\n      proc.stdout.off(\"data\", onData);\n      proc.stderr.off(\"data\", onData);\n      proc.off(\"exit\", onExit);\n      settle(value);\n    };\n    const onData = (chunk) => {\n      buf += chunk.toString();\n      const m = stripAnsi(buf).match(/Local\\s+(https?:\\/\\/\\S+)/);\n      // The printed Local URL already carries the /domotion base path; keep only\n      // the origin so appending PATH_ON_SITE doesn't double it.\n      if (m) finish(resolve, new URL(m[1]).origin);\n    };\n    const onExit = (code) => finish(\n      reject,\n      new Error(`astro dev exited early (code ${code})${buf.trim() ? `\\n${stripAnsi(buf).trim()}` : \"\"}`),\n    );\n    proc.stdout.on(\"data\", onData);\n    proc.stderr.on(\"data\", onData);\n    proc.on(\"exit\", onExit);\n    timer = setTimeout(() => finish(reject, new Error(\"timed out waiting for astro dev\")), 90_000);"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "test-evidence"
            ],
